Psalm 119:1-8

1 Bléssed are thóse whose wáy is blámeless,
who wálk in the láw of the LÓRD!
2 Bléssed are thóse who kéep his decrées!
With áll their héarts they séek him.

3 They néver do ánything évil,
but wálk in his wáys.
4 You have láid dówn your précepts
to be cárefully képt.

5 May my wáys be fírm
in kéeping your státutes.
6 Thén I shall not be pút to sháme
as I obsérve áll your commánds.

7 I will thánk you with an úpright héart,
as I léarn your just júdgments.
8 I will kéep your státutes;
do not éver forsáke me.

Glóry to the Fáther, and to the Són,
and to the Hóly Spírit:
as it wás in the begínning, is nów,
and will be for éver. Amén.
